=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Erlene} in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} at (J-8) to begin quest. You will be given {@k} {k:Ulbrecht's sealed letter}.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} at (H-6) for a cutscene.

:* You may need to speak to him multiple tines if you have not completed the {p:Bastok (S) questline|Category:Bastok Markets (S) Quests} - if, for instance, he mentions that he has never heard of a {@k} {k:bundle of half-inscribed scrolls|Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls}, you will need to speak to him again.

* Travel to the SW corner of {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} to touch the **Indescript Markings** targetable location, on the grid line between (E-11) and (E-10) for a cutscene. You will obtain {@k} {k:Schultz's sealed letter}.
